BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:constructor-nexademy-anomaly-zurich-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261024T134407Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261029T174500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261029T200000
SUMMARY:Workshop: The Anomaly in Plain Sight
LOCATION:Nexademy\, Förrlibuckstrasse 150\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:A hands-on evening on anomalies nobody flagged: how people appr
 oach unfamiliar data\, feature engineering and machine learning to surface
  hidden patterns with a look at Polars\, why a flagged transaction is not 
 yet fraud\, and using generative AI to explain detection results in plain 
 language.\n\nOrganiser: Constructor Nexademy Switzerland\n\nDetails and re
 gistration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/constructor-nexademy-anomaly
 -zurich-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/constructor-nexademy-anomaly-zurich-2
 026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
