SUMMARY:GFN AI Day
LOCATION:GFN Hub\, ORBIZ Josef\, Josefstrasse 214a\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:A working day rather than a talking one: a morning of practitio
 ner talks from SSF\, ZHAW\, Correntics and Resilens on what AI can actuall
 y do for sustainable finance\, then small groups spend the afternoon on re
 al challenges submitted by GFN startups and demo what they built. Thirty p
 laces.\n\nOrganiser: Green FinTech Network\n\nDetails and registration: ht
 tps://swissdataevents.ch/events/gfn-ai-day-zurich-2026/
